          "documentation": "系统提取论文标题、章节、段落、页码及图表或公式上下文，形成论文片段。"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLUseCase",
          "_id": "uc_analyze_code",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "tracelab_use_case_model"
          },
